>> title: Puttanesca Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: tomato, anchovy, olives, pasta, stovetop
>> servings: 4
>> time: 35 min
>> step.1: melt anchovies 3 min
>> step.2: warm 1 min
>> step.3: simmer 20 min
>> step.4: season off heat

Warm @garlic{4%cloves}(thinly sliced) and @anchovy fillets{6}(chopped) in @extra-virgin olive oil{1/4%cup}(60 mL) over medium-low heat for ~{3%min}, mashing until the anchovies melt.

Warm @Kalamata olives{1/2%cup}(70 g; pitted and halved), @capers{2%Tbs}(rinsed), and @red pepper flakes{1/2%tsp} in @&(~1)anchovy oil{} for ~{1%min}.

Simmer @&(~1)base{} with @whole peeled tomatoes{28%oz}(800 g; crushed by hand) and @dried oregano{1/2%tsp} for ~{20%min}.

Season @&(~1)sauce{} off the heat with @flat-leaf parsley{1/4%cup}(chopped) and @black pepper{1/4%tsp}.
